# Lobby & invite join (all games)

Lobby / online join is **the same for every game**. Use `shared/kit.js` — do not reinvent per game.

## Invite link / QR (`?room=ABCD`)

When the URL has a 4-character `room` param (copy link or QR):

- **Hide** Create room (`#btn-create`)
- **Hide** Solo / bot / practice (`#btn-solo`, `#solo-home-row`, `#home-pack`)
- **Hide** the manual join-code field (code already comes from the URL)
- **Show** Join as `Join room ABCD` (`#btn-join`)
- **Show** Leave this invite (`#btn-invite-leave`)
- Do **not** show a “create lobby” path on that screen

`MiniGames.init()` already calls `MiniGames.setInviteHome(roomParam)`.  
Going home / leaving invite: `MiniGames.clearInviteHome()` or `setInviteHome("")` after `stripRoomFromUrl()`.

## Required home IDs

| ID | Role |
|----|------|
| `#btn-create` | Create room |
| `#btn-join` | Join |
| `#join-code` | Manual code (hidden on invite) |
| `#btn-solo` | Solo / vs bot (hidden on invite) |
| `#btn-invite-leave` | Leave invite (auto-injected by kit if missing) |
| `#home-hint` | Optional hint text (swapped on invite) |
| `#name` | Player name |

## Do / don’t

```text
✅ MG.init(...) then MG.bindHome({ onCreate, onJoin, onSolo, onLeave, ... })
✅ MG.setInviteHome(code) / MG.clearInviteHome()
✅ Host lobby may show QR + Start; guests do not “create”

❌ Custom invite UI that still shows Create or Solo on ?room=
❌ Asking the user again to “hide create when joining by link”
❌ Different lobby invite rules per game
```

## New games

Copy an existing home/lobby shell, load `shared/kit.js`, call `init` + `bindHome`. Invite hide/show is free.
